.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
search \- Search local snippets (name, description, tags, commands)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsearch\fR [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-visibility\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-long\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search local snippets (name, description, tags, commands)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Only show snippets with this tag
.TP
\fB\-\-visibility\fR \fI<VISIBILITY>\fR
Only show snippets whose last\-synced visibility matches (public, unlisted or private)
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Sort order (default: as listed)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
name: Name, A\-Z
.IP \(bu 2
recent: Most recently modified first
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<SINCE>\fR
Only show snippets modified within this duration (e.g. 30m, 24h, 7d, 2w)
.TP
\fB\-\-long\fR
Show the long table instead of compact rows
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Search text
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg search docker
  fg search docker \-\-tag ubuntu \-\-long
